  <img class="kk-photo" src="/images/brandon-aubey-880.jpg" alt="Brandon Aubey" />
  <p class="kk-dear">Howdy.</p>
  <p>It looks like you like reading. Or you're checking us out before you call. Either way, good.</p>
  <p>We have no idea how you got here. Maybe you saw one of our ads. Maybe a friend told you about us. If so, buy them a coffee.</p>
  <p>Anyhow. You're here because your business isn't where you want it to be, or it's doing fine and you want more. Not to hear about us. So here's the short version.</p>
  <h2>THE SHORT VERSION</h2>
  <p>I'm Brandon. I spent ten years helping local businesses get more customers before I started Dead River out of El Paso, Texas, a year ago.</p>
  <p>Ten years of watching good businesses pay for clicks while the phone went to voicemail. Spaghetti at the wall. A little of this, a little of that, and an agency sending a pretty report every month while nothing changed.</p>
  <p>That's the problem Dead River was built to fix.</p>
  <p>Here's the stats:</p>
  <ul class="kk-list">
    <li>Over $7 million in client revenue we can point to.</li>
    <li>Over 5,000 jobs booked for our clients.</li>
    <li>Over 40 businesses, in 30 niches, across 20 states.</li>
    <li>Google Partner. Meta Business Partner.</li>
    <li>5-star rated on Google and Facebook.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The numbers don't lie. Go read the case studies and see for yourself.</p>
  <h2>WHAT WE ACTUALLY DO</h2>
  <p>We're a marketing agency, but we're a little bit different, because we start with who's looking instead of with the ad.</p>
  <p>We built a tool called Demand Intelligence. It watches recent search activity across 280 million U.S. consumer profiles, updated every day, and tells us who in your market is looking for what you sell right now. Your ads, your emails, and your calls go to those people. Not to everybody.</p>
  <p>Then we build the page, run the ads on Google and Facebook, set up the follow-up, and make sure every lead gets a call back inside five minutes. You answer the phone. We do the rest.</p>
  <p>And we put it in writing. $50,000 in new revenue in 45-60 days, or your money back, plus $500 for wasting your time.</p>
  <h2>WHAT WE'RE NOT INTERESTED IN</h2>
  <p>We're not interested in "impressions." We're not interested in sitting around talking about how many views the video got. We're not interested in a report you have to squint at to find out whether the phone rang.</p>
  <p>We want you to get customers. So you can take care of your people. So we look good and get more clients. So we can take care of ours. That's the whole business model, and it only works if you win.</p>
  <h2>HOW WE WORK</h2>
  <p>Honest, even when it's not what you want to hear. If you're not a fit, we'll tell you on the first call. If we mess up, you'll hear it from us first, with what happened and how we're fixing it. We'd rather lose a client than lie to one.</p>
  <p>If you keep doing what you're doing, you're going to keep getting what you're getting. So, food for thought. There's a button below. It gets you 30 minutes with us, free, and we'll tell you straight whether we can help.</p>
